                  {
                    "value": "1. Number of NoWs Issued in FY 26/27      2. NoWs Issued same time last FY 25/26      3. NoWs Issued in the last month of current FY 26/27",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12px",
                      "color": "#013366",
                      "fontFamily": "BC Sans"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Counts are distinct issued permit actions — New Permits (OGP) and Amendments (AMD) — excluding administrative amendments, based on the permit issue date.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12px",
                      "color": "#252423",
                      "fontFamily": "BC Sans"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The left chart shows NoWs issued per fiscal year (FY2021/22–FY2025/26). The right chart shows NoWs issued by fiscal month from April 2023, broken down by type. Both split into two series: New Permit and Amendments.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12px",
                      "color": "#252423",
                      "fontFamily": "BC Sans"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Data reflects the current gold layer; issued-permit counts collapse after FY2021/22 and will read low until the NoW source (now_application / permit_amendment) is refreshed.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12px",
                      "color": "#8a6d1a",
                      "fontFamily": "BC Sans"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Contact Raj (Rajneesh.1.Gulati@gov.bc.ca) or Nhung (Nhung.Nguyen@gov.bc.ca) for more information.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12px",
